spice
* SPICE netlist
Rrb 1 2 r_b
Vpi 3 1 V_pi
Ccpi 2 1 C_pi
Rrmu 2 3 r_mu
Cc_mu 2 3 C_mu
Ggm 3 4 VALUE={g_m*V(3,1)}
Rro 4 5 r_o
Rrc 5 6 r_c
Cc_s 5 0 C_s
Rrex 4 7 r_ex

* Nodes
* 1: V_pi negative, C_pi negative
* 2: Common node with V_pi positive, C_pi positive, r_mu start
* 3: Common node between r_mu end, Gm control, C_mu, starting node of Gm
* 4: Output of Gm, start node for r_o, r_ex
* 5: End node for r_o, start node for r_c, C_s
* 6: End node for r_c
* 7: End node for r_ex
* 0: Ground reference